# pictures that were given up: kept on disk for the user to look at, not part of the art
*.rejected.png
*.rejected.*.png
# pictures as they were before they were painted again for their camera: shown to the generator
*.before.png
*.before.*.png
# the attempts of the picture being worked on, until the closest one is recorded
.tries/
# pictures laid on grass for the agent's eye
.look/
# earlier pictures laid onto their footprint, made on demand as references for later ones
.fitted/
# review sheets with the footprint and wall lines drawn over the pictures
review/*-angles.png
# a picture on its way through the shell as text, left behind by an agent that was interrupted
*.b64
